        "created_at": "2013-12-20T06:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"stevelabny\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/stevelabny/48/2536_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> stevelabny:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He is awesome.&nbsp;Soft to the touch, not over-stuffed, nicely detailed, nice shade of red.&nbsp; I am extremely happy with my purchase.&nbsp;My errata cards weren't in the box though. Maybe Mr. Chomps ate them?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Seconded.&nbsp; But my Chomps is better, as he refrained from consuming my errata cards.</p>",
